{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35151","headline":"诗品二十四则 洗炼 · 司空图","name":"诗品二十四则 洗炼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"犹鑛出金，如铅出银。\n超心炼冶，绝爱[缁]磷。\n空潭泻春，古镜照神。\n体素储洁，乘月返真。\n载瞻星辰，载歌幽人。\n流水今日，明月前身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}